  "notes": "Dropdown can open a menu or any other element when the button is clicked.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/dropdown/+page.md",
  "code": "<!-- change popover-1 and --anchor-1 names. Use unique names for each dropdown -->\n<button class=\"btn\" popovertarget=\"popover-1\" style=\"anchor-name:--anchor-1\">\n  Button\n</button>\n<ul class=\"dropdown menu w-52 rounded-box bg-base-100 shadow-sm\"\n  popover id=\"popover-1\" style=\"position-anchor:--anchor-1\">\n  <li><a>Item 1</a></li>\n  <li><a>Item 2</a></li>\n</ul>",
